{"posts":[{"id":"hs_p19_451","t":"wrong time trade.closed the sell trade\n\nbought eurusd.I wait AUDUSD week ftr.\n\ni wait QM EURAUD like your chart","a":"glory305","d":"","n":"#451","p":19,"im":["673adb3f0923e706f4133cac8454655417410308","d96dc7c5df69ee30018e8c2ca4bade71f3ca914f"],"m":451},{"id":"hs_p19_452","t":"","a":"glory305","d":"","n":"#452","p":19,"im":["d96dc7c5df69ee30018e8c2ca4bade71f3ca914f"],"m":452},{"id":"hs_p19_453","t":"\" Whenever- is this the FTR you are talking about (red rectangle)? Thanks! \"\n\nYep!","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#453","p":19,"im":[],"m":453},{"id":"hs_p19_454","t":"Not trading today because of the US Holiday. Not enough liquidity in the market.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#454","p":19,"im":[],"m":454},{"id":"hs_p19_455","t":"patience and work hard","a":"glory305","d":"","n":"#455","p":19,"im":["329c9bc5a4625858648591509e4d8e63c087dfb3","9ad339a07847eb05d2fb71ba63e8baa8ff321f02","d753fea238ec7e0affb4dce03626386121200269","07b84eafa3a2bc2af04065cc604a19869675d597"],"m":455},{"id":"hs_p19_456","t":"I may have to take a break from trading for a time due to a personal issue I am dealing with (nothing related to trading). It could be a day, it could be week, it could be a few months. I can't be sure.\n\nThank you to everyone here who has helped me so much these past months. You guys are awesome.\n\nHopefully I'll be back soon.\n\n-H","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#456","p":19,"im":[],"m":456},{"id":"hs_p19_457","t":"Stay safe mate. Take care.\n\nRobbie","a":"Rdk123","d":"","n":"#457","p":19,"im":[],"m":457},{"id":"hs_p19_458","t":"It has been a painfully long year, but I am back.\n\nIt is nice to see that RTM is doing well. I plan on posting again on a semi-regular basis as I get re-acquainted with the market.\n\nThis chart looks interesting. I will look for a reaction here once price returns.\n\nSame chart, more detail:","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#458","p":19,"im":["03333a4bd8b22eecab933d2d320b92fa7355852d","6c92a41668b9ee90291f1bc0349c7415b808b827"],"m":458},{"id":"hs_p19_459","t":"Here is a nice trading opportunity from a couple of months ago.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#459","p":19,"im":["35de81aa0f37150b82720ada21d09f9ceb7ce4ff"],"m":459},{"id":"hs_p19_460","t":"hey hoeschec welcome back again to RTM community good start hoeschec","a":"omidfxt","d":"","n":"#460","p":19,"im":[],"m":460},{"id":"hs_p19_461","t":"I am looking at E/U 1HR and here is what I am seeing...\n\nIf price engulfs the orange line to the downside, I would be looking for a short with a TG near the S/R flip & Flag. The compression on approach to the supply zone makes me think price might move down again before collecting Buys and moving upwards.\n\nI can't help but notice what looks to be an engulf to the upside however, and so I am also anticipating the possibility that price will break to the upside. For now, I am waiting to see what happens.\n\nHere is the entry order with my entry, stop, and limit. Approx 1:7 RR (Since tomorrow is NFP I am only setting this on a demo for practice)","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#461","p":19,"im":["ba0c4c9b85ba2bef967b32c85423641404f50a56","4d63491c463e7233e2657137dc55a4060ee424e6"],"m":461},{"id":"hs_p19_462","t":"USD-CHF 1-HR Chart:\n\nI am looking at a engulf coupled with some hesitation. I am waiting for price to EG the orange line for an indication that price will move upwards towards the origin of the EG. Might make for a nice short opportunity.\n\nHere is a 15M chart that gives a little more detail. The origin of the engulf looks like it has strong supply - nice cap with momentum.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#462","p":19,"im":["b526da2ac6d9d7a89c2b0732d59937d4672118f3","8651fb375370bb1ea3751f4e3d71c5771028a8d6"],"m":462},{"id":"hs_p19_463","t":"USD -JPY 4-HR\n\nI am watching this pair for a strong bullish close above the Daily S/R level, coupled with a pin up retest. Looks like there might be some room to move up to fresh supply. So far there haven't been enough buyers to push price convincingly past this S/R Level...","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#463","p":19,"im":["14724813d66c7d27f33f6c68ea68b0749979e5fa"],"m":463},{"id":"hs_p19_464","t":"EUR-USD","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#464","p":19,"im":["d70a2a6d2211d8a04c0f763fd20807130806f016"],"m":464},{"id":"hs_p19_465","t":"Just some practice....","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#465","p":19,"im":["17872f57809dce45d378c7748eb494116a56eadb"],"m":465},{"id":"hs_p19_466","t":"I've noticed these S/R flips are great places to trade on FTB to the FTR -\n\nEUR-USD 4HR","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#466","p":19,"im":["7d04f8bb790b49407b8961f586281b05fa715fc9"],"m":466},{"id":"hs_p19_467","t":"More 4HR EUR-USD","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#467","p":19,"im":["c2ad2ce083c30bb0c768b0da60d4ebd1595ae760"],"m":467},{"id":"hs_p19_468","t":"EUR-USD 4-HR\n\nHere is an example when price blew right through the demand on its FTB to the FTR that formed after price broke a S/R Flip. From the look of the chart, it seems like this was probably a news event that caused the spike to occur.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#468","p":19,"im":["22d705e75820449c86c0d46a7be6161712000b70"],"m":468},{"id":"hs_p19_469","t":"USD-JPY\n\nLimit would have been set at base of the pole. The stop would have been pretty tight. Nice R:R on this one...","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#469","p":19,"im":["b05d518fe94c7814830d5798387805b92c379d22"],"m":469},{"id":"hs_p19_470","t":"U-J 1-Min Chart:\n\nSame concept, although I'd refer to the higher time frames first to make sure I am trading in the right direction.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#470","p":19,"im":["3c82faaa1f3127dc691de234047b1b2b972e173a"],"m":470},{"id":"hs_p19_471","t":"USD- CAD 15M\n\nI've noticed that an engulf of an original FTR to the left that forms an opposing FTR (at a S/R Flip) ends up reacting when price returns on its first time back. It is kind of hard to explain in words, so here is an example I just found:","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#471","p":19,"im":["ba7b72502582132a919b38279a814a1757b9efd7"],"m":471},{"id":"hs_p19_472","t":"Here is a live trade I just took (demo). Not sure if this will follow through, but it looks interesting.\n\nAUD-CAD M5:","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#472","p":19,"im":["5a32a27c7bc571f857984840bd766b7c4aaa09d7"],"m":472},{"id":"hs_p19_473","t":"Here is a question I've been thinking about lately:\n\nWhen it comes to supply/demand areas, where are the actual orders located? Here is a chart that illustrates my question:\n\nDo I draw the demand box to include the upper wick area or the candle close?\n\nAnyone have an opinion on this? Thanks!\n\nHere is what looks to be the decision point for price as it moved up originally, on a 15 minute chart. Would this be where the substantial orders are located?","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#473","p":19,"im":["ea75026fecf3d42fb4676024c50d255247b3e528","0c362b804456ede3d374ec22d432a9150b90b7bd"],"m":473},{"id":"hs_p19_474","t":"EUR-JPY Analysis:\n\nI want to go long on this, as price is forming at a historical S/R level, but I think price could drop again into the demand zone for more buy orders. I included a 15M chart and a 1 Min chart to identify all the minor S/R levels and associated supply/demand levels. Here is what I've come up with:","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#474","p":19,"im":["9193db166a2018852372d3b28768c700127a5ca8","759495610c88a41a28bfd86ce0c91afe7e073295","110dd548c649b7fb485fa5f14db924711c0ce4a6"],"m":474},{"id":"hs_p19_475","t":"Eur-Aud\n\nWatching this area... I'm not sure, but I think the long wicks are indicating sells are accumulating @ S/R flip area.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#475","p":19,"im":["75aa02a6147988d5e16bfbe162d8701f85f99c5e"],"m":475}],"images":[{"k":"673adb3f0923e706f4133cac8454655417410308","t":"assets/thumbs/673adb3f0923e706f4133cac8454655417410308.webp","f":"assets/images/673adb3f0923e706f4133cac8454655417410308.png","w":1170,"h":721,"b":52707,"o":"673adb3f0923e706f4133cac8454655417410308.png","p":19,"pid":"hs_p19_451"},{"k":"d96dc7c5df69ee30018e8c2c